{"seq":2,"slug":"business-controversies","title":"商业争议","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/controversies-and-appraisal/business-controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"promises-and-timelines","title":"承诺与时间表","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/controversies-and-appraisal/business-controversies/promises-and-timelines","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"regulatory-and-financial","title":"监管与财务争议","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/controversies-and-appraisal/business-controversies/regulatory-and-financial","wordCount":1563,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"商业争议\">商业争议</h1><p>马斯克的争议，也体现在他的商业行为上。本章考察两个核心层面。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;承诺与时间表&quot;——他屡屡做出过于乐观的承诺却频频跳票的模式。第二篇文档讲述&quot;监管与财务争议&quot;,揭示他激进不羁的商业风格，与监管规则及财务审慎之间的张力。</p>\n"}